<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Petili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua jukutumbulii jaka Petili</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petili</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Peti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua jukutumbulii jaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petili</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ju kutumbuli jaka Petili jiandikwi nu ntumi Petili. Petili jatumbuliya balua jaki suku pwaga jombi nya na jwaandaki akanya. Jaandakiya bandu boti ba bunhobale Kilisitu, “Bajwakemika ageni.” Mu lipungu 1:1 na mu lipungu 1:17 na mu lipungu 2:11. Mala jingi jombi jaalogo bandu baasoma balua yaki kuliina heli, bababia apiti kutama mu ndema ndalindali. Bandu bingi ahobale ana, balua jukutumbuli jaka Petili jaandikwa baada ja balua kwa Aepesu pambipi na yaka mu saka sa 65 baada jukubelekwa Kilisitu, ndaba balua jenze jilengana na balua jaka Pauli kwa Aepesu. Petili jaandika balua jenze kuhuma ku Loma jejuje jujikemika Babuloni, mu lipungu la 5:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petili jupwaga ana, juandiki balua jenze ili, “Kunngangamalisa moju nu kumpwagi mwanganya ganagabweni nu kujoana ana lijambu heli la waamboni wa sakaka waka Sapanga.” Mu lipungu la 5:12. Kubii na majambu gingi gagalengana kati jiitabu yaka Petili, mu lipungu la 2:11-3:7 na balua jaka Pauli kwa Aepesu, mu lipungu la 5:18-6:9 na balua kwa Akolosai 3:18-4:6. Mapungu goa matatu haga gaboa mabole kupete kutama pamu mu nyumba na kwaajoane akolongu. Kabee jahingamaki bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu kunhinakali paapata mang'aliku ndaba masoba ga mwisu gahegali, mu lipungu la 4:1.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Petili jujimanyisa mweni kwa asomaji baki, mu lipungu la 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee junsengu Sapanga ndaba ju uwokopu goajopiki boti na gubii na mana boo mu maisa gabu, mu lipungu la 1:3-2:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee jaabola bandu baahobale namuna jukutama sapi pundema na jumanyisa indela ndalindali jukutama pamu kati ja nndomi nu nhanamundu nu ntumwa nu nkolongu waki, mu lipungu la 2:11-4:11.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwenikatai Petili jahingamaki kuhinakali kipindi sa mang'aliku, mu lipungu la 4:12-5:11.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwisu weni jupunga balua jaki, mu lipungu la 5:12-14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nepani Petili, ntumi waka Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Nunhandaki mwanganya mwabandu monhaguliwi na Sapanga, babube ntawanyiki nu ntama ngati bandu baatiliki nndema wabu ku Ponto nuku Galatia nuku Kapadokia nuku Asia nuku Bitunia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Sapanga Atati bummanyi mwanganya nu kunhagu mwanganya toka mwandi, nukunhenga mwabandu ba sapi kwindela ja Loho waki, ili nhwesa kunzetake Yesu Kilisitu nu kunyambiswa kwa mwai waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Nundobe kwaka Sapanga uamboni nu lukwali lwingipi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunhobale nganganganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Julumbalika Sapanga na Atati baka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu! Kwi ikia yaki hingi jutuhenga tusaliwa kabee ili tupata kuhobale kokubii kwomi su kunhyoa Yesu kuhuma kwa bandu baawii, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />ili tupata ulisi gogugwe Sapanga jaabekila bandu baki. Sapanga jaabeki ulisi hogu kunani kwaka Sapanga kokujeni ngaseguwesa kubola au kuhalabika au kujina. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Heyi ibiya inu mwanganya mombii nndendwa na Sapanga na makili gaka Sapanga kwi indela jukuhobale, ili mpata wokopu goguwe gubii tayali kuyekuliwa pa mwisu wa masoba.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ntoguliya kupete lijambu le heli, hata ngati sajenu, kwa masoba masokopi mwipalika kuba nu usungu ndaba ji milengu ndalindali jukunng'alika, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />kulegwa kwinu hoku kupala kulangi kuhobale kwinu hekubii. Hata zaabu jejihalabika, jiipemwa kwa mwotu, ahelahela nu kuhobale kwinu, kokubii na mana ngani kupeta zahabu kupalika kupemwa ili kubonikana kwa sakaka. Hapa ndi pamwijopa ulumbi nu ukolongu ni isima lisoba lejihika Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Mwanganya mumpai, hata ngati ngasenhwaiki kummbona, kabee munhobale hata ngati ngasemubweni sajenu. Henu ntogule kukutogule kukolongu ngamaa kwanga kulongaleka, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ndaba nnzopa nhupi jukuhobale kwinu jejuje ndi uokopu winu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Alota baka Sapanga balalukiyalakiya nu kulingalilingali kupete uokovu hogu, balotila kugulongale uamboni waka Sapanga hogu gomwakapata mwanganya. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Balenga kutaputa kipindi na pandu papipitila lijambu heli, yani kipindi sejabiya julongi Loho waka Kilisitu jojabi nkati jabu, koni julote kupete mang'aliku gagampata Kilisitu nu ulumbi gogwampata. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Sapanga jayekuliya alota lihengu labu heli ngaselabiya lakwaajangati beni ila ndaba jinu, kipindi pababii apwaga majambu haga gaguge mwanganya nzoini sajenu kuhuma kwa bala atumisi babundandila Lijambu la Amboni kwa makili ga Loho wa Sapanga jojatumwa kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga. Haga ndi majambu gaguge hata atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga bapai kugamanya.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukemwa kukutama ku Usapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Henu, mmbiya tayali nu kukeluki. Mmbeka kuhobale kwinu kwoti mu wamboni gola gobampekiya kipindi Yesu Kilisitu pajibonikana! <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ngati mwabana baka Sapanga babunzetake, mwiijetake kupwata ndokule iliya yemwabii naku kipindi pamwabii mwaang'ang'a. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ila mpalika kuba mwa sapi mu mahengu ginu goti, ngati jojunkemiki ejubii wa sapi. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Maandiku gapwaaga: “Mmbiya mwabandu ba sapi, ndaba nepani nu sapi.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ndaba mwaloba Atati, jojutemu bandu boti kulengana na mahengu gabu bila kupendale, henu ntama pundema pani su kunzogopa Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ndaba mmanyiki ana mwanganya mwakombuliwa kuhuma mu majambu gamwagayobali ganga kupalika gamwajopa kuhuma kwa aseja binu. Lakini ngasemwakombuliwa kwa hindu yehihalabika ngati feza na zaabu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ila kwa mwai wa bei ngolongo waka Kilisitu, jojuwe jojabi ngati likondoo langa ni likosa wala lidoa. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Jombi jahaguliwi na Sapanga kabula jukubomba nndema, jayekuliwa lisoba la mwisu ndaba jinu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu, munhobale Sapanga joanhyoa kuhuma kwa bandu baawii nu kundumbali, na hela nhobale nu kunhobale kwinu kubii kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ndienu, sukujetake usakaka, mwanganya muinyambisika loho hinu na kwaapala ajinu bila kulikopake, henu mpalana kwa mwoju wote. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ndaba kwi indela ji Lilobi la womi laka Sapanga, mwanganya nsaliwi kabee, nga ngati bana ba atati baawesa kuwa. Ila atati banga kuwa yaka petapeta. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ngati Maandiku egapwaga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">“Kila mundu ndi ngati manyoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">nu ukolongu waki woti gubii ngati liua lu mwikioli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Manyoi gatenda kunyala na maua gatenda kuabuka.<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Lakini Lilobi laka Bambu litama yaka petapeta.” Lilobi leheli ndi Lijambu la Amboni lebundandila mwanganya.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Lilibu lyomi nu nndema wa sapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ndienu, nkotuka ubaja woti, ni isoli nu kukopake waamboni, wipu na malobi giliya giikuba kabee. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ngati bana asoku heatokule masiba, nanamu kabee mpalika kuba na hamu ja masiba ga sapi gi kiloho ganga kuhangangana na sindu, ili kwa makili gaki nhwesa kukola mu uwokopu, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />nahenu mmanyiki ana: Bambu ndi jwaamboni.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Henu munzendila jombi jojubii lilibu lelibii lyomi, lelikanakiwi na bandu ila kwaka Sapanga lijetakiwi ndi lilibu le lihaguliwi na la bei ngolongu nganii. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Munzendila jombi ngati malibu gagabii gomi mo nsengwiki kuba nnyumba iki loho momuje mwiitumakia ngati agolu ba sapi baka Sapanga, kuboa litambiku la loho lelumpala Sapanga kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ndaba Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“Linga! Meka lilibu luku Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">lilibu lu nsingi, lelihaguliwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Mundu joanhobale hoju nga bampoi lihamo.” <verse eid="1PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kwinu mwanganya, lilibu le heli ndi la bei ngolongu; lakini kwa bala banga kunhobale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“Lilibu leakaniki bandu baasenga nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">henu libii lilibu likolongu lu nsingi.” <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Kabee Maandiku gapwaga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">“Lilibu ndi lilibu lukulikobando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">lilibu la kwaahabu bandu.” Bandu bilikobandoo ndaba ngasebagahobale malobi gaki, na hela ndi hekwapitila ngati Sapanga hejwapanga.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Lakini mwanganya ndi kibeleku sekihaguliwi, agolu bu ubambu nkolongu, kibeleku sa sapi; bandu baka Sapanga mweni, monhaguliwi kulandi mahengu makolongu gaka Sapanga jojunkemi kuhuma kulwii, janzingisa mu unang'anu waki nkolongu. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Pamwandi mwanganya ngasemwabii mwabandu baka Sapanga, lakini henu mwanganya ndi mwabandu baki; pamwandi mwanganya ngasebumboni ikia yaka Sapanga, lakini henu nnzopiki ikia.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atumisi baka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Mwaapali bangu, nundobaleke ngamaa mwanganya ngati mwaageni na mwabandu mompeta pani pundema! Mwijileka ndokule ja nhyega yeyuye ipengana na loho. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Tabia jinu kati ja bandu banga kummanya Sapanga jipalika kuba jaamboni ngani, ili hata pabankopakiya ana ntenda liya, awesa kumanya mahengu ginu ga amboni na henu bundumbalia Sapanga lisoba lukuhika kwaki.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ndienu nzetakia kulongoswa na aka kilongosi boti ndaba jaka Bambu: Kunzowane Bambu nkolongu jojulongosa, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />kwaajowane akolongu bi mikoa babube ahaguliwi najombi ili kwaapeke azabu bandu baahenga makosa na kwaalumbali bandu baahenga gaamboni. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ndaba Sapanga jupala nhwesa kwaahenga bandu akotuka mahengu gi king'ang'a ganga na malangu ku kulangi mahengu gaamboni ganhenga. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ntama ngati bandu baalekakiwi; lakini mwiitumii kulekakewa hoku kuiya ubaja, ila ntama ngati atumisi baka Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mwaatendila isima bandu boka, mwapala ajinu babunhobale Kilisitu, mungungamaliya Sapanga, mutendila isima bambu nkolongu.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganu ga Mang'aliku gaka Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Mwaatumisi, mwajetakaliya akolongu binu kwi isima yoti, hata ngati biibia baamboni au babilihulu au baasukisa. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ndaba ana nhinakali ubini wa mang'aliku ganga kupalika ndaba mmanya Sapanga jupala hela, nala Sapanga jampekia mbengalelu. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ndaba, mwiipata seketuli boo ana nhinakali mang'aliku gampalika kupata ndaba ja makosa ginu mwabete? Lakini ana nhinakali mang'aliku hata ngaati nhengiki gaamboni, Sapanga ampekia mbengelelu ndaba ja hela. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Haga ndi gabunkemi; ndaba Kilisitu mweni jang'alika ndaba jinu mwanganya, jundekila lilenganu, ili mumpwata. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Jombi ngasejatei mahakau, wala ngasejalongi isoli. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Pabuntondola jombi ngasejajibua sindu jombi ngase anhenga mundu jokapi kujogopa, ila jabeka kwaka Sapanga kuhobale kwaki, Sapanga jojutemu kwa sakaka. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Jombi mweni jagatotula mahakau gitu mu nhyega jaki panani ju nsalaba, ili tukotuka kuhenga mahakau, nukutama kukuhenga mahengu gagunndengane Sapanga ngati hejupala. Kukuhumiswa kwaki mwanganya npatiki womi. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Mwanganya mwabiya ngati makondoo gagabiya gahobiki; lakini henu munkelubuki Nndimi nu nndonda wa loho inu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Ahanu na Alomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Nanamu mwakammbomba mo nzukuliwi, nzetakia kulongoswa na aka alomi bii, ili ana abii akanalomi bangakuhobale lilobi laka Sapanga awesa kulihobale kupete mahengu gi gamboni. Ngasekupalika kumpwagi sindu sokape, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />enu bagubona mahengu gi hegabi sapi na hemundumbali Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Kulilemba kwinu kwiikuba kwa kunza, ngati kuloka nyweli, kuwata hindu yealenganaki kwa zaabu niingobu ya sapi ngamaa. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ila kulemba jinu kubiya mu moju, kulilemba kwinu kwangakualabika kwa kuba waamboni na loho jukulihulu, jejuje jejipalika ngani palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ndaba hela ndi ebijilemba pa mwandi akabomba baasapi baka Sapanga ba bunhobale sapanga; baajetaki kulongoswa na alomi babu. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Ngati Sala eanzetakia nndomi waki Ibulahimu nukunkema Bambu. Mwanganya mwakakamwali baka Sala ana ntei majambu gaambonii na bila kujogopa lijambu lokapi.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Ahelahe nanamu mwakanalomi, ntamannya na akahanu binu kwa malangu, nanamu mwaatendila isima, koni mmanya bombi asaipu na ngati alisi pamu na mwanganya mu nhupi ja womi, ili sikuba sindu sokapi sukupenga kuloba kwinu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kung'alika ndaba jukuhenga gaamboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Mwisu mbwaga ana: Mpalika kuba na mwoju gumu, nukuholale kumu; mpalika kupalana su ulongu na kuba mwabandu bini ikia na moju ukulihulu kwinu mwabe kwa mwabe. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Mwaalepa bandu giliya kwa uliya au litondu ku litondu; ila mwaalobila mbengalelu, ndaba mwanganya mwakemwa na Sapanga ili mpata mbengalelu. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ngati egapwaga Maandiku ga Sapi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">“Jojupala kutama sukutogule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">nukulibona lisoba la amboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">julipengaliya jipwaga giliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">jujogupa kupwaga isole.”<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />“Jukotuka kuhenga mahengu giliya, juhenga gaamboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">jutaputa lukwali nu kuhenga.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ndaba Bambu jaalingali kwa waamboni bandu baajetakiwi palongi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">nukujoane kuloba kwabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Lakini jaang'anambuka bandu baahenga majambu giliya.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Boo, nya jojuwesa kuntende mwanganya liya ana nhenga gaamboni? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Lakini hata ngati kwiipalika kung'alika ndaba jukuhenga gaamboni, nala, mwanganya mpengaliwi. Mwanzogopa mundu jokapi, wala mwijetake kunzingi mu kiholu. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Lakini mu nndumbalia Kilisitu ngati Bambu mu mioju jino. Mmbiya tayali kunzibu jokapi jojandalukiya kupete kuhobale kokubii nkati jino. Lakini nhenga hela sukulihulu ni isima. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Mmbiya na mawasu gaamboni, ili pa buntondoo, baapwaga ubaja wa mahengu gii gaamboni ngati bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu ili abona iyoni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ndaba nambanga kupata mang'aliku ndaba jukuhenga gaamboni, ana Sapanga jupai, kuliku kung'alika ndaba jukuhenga giliya. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kwa ndaba Kilisitu jakuwa ndaba ja mahakau ginu, jakuwa mala jimu pena, mundu hoju jwabii mundu jwaamboni kwa ndaba ja abaja, ili jumpelika mwanganya kwaka Sapanga. Jakomika nhyega lakini jahengwa kuba mwomi kiloho: <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Nukutama kwaki kwi kiloho, jajenda kaalandi loho yeyabia biikongiki koatama bandu bawii. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Haba ndi bala babakana kunzoane Sapanga pajalendaliya ngani kipindi Noa pajabiya juandaa safina. Nkati ja safina je heji babi bandu asokopi pena, yani bandu nani, babaokuliwa mu masi, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />masi ge gala gabiya lilenganu lu ubatisu gogunhoko mwanganya sajenu. Ubatisu nga sindu sukuboa usapu mu nhnhyega, ila ndi lilaganu kwaka Sapanga lelihengeka mu moju gogulangi ngasegubii na mahakau. Junhokua kwi indela jukuyoka kwaka Yesu Kilisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />jojuwe jajenda kunani kwaka Sapanga na henu jutami kumalele, julongoswa na Atumi, akolongu na baabii nu uwesu nkolongu bu kunani kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Kutama kunyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Ndaba Kilisitu jwatenda kung'alika mu nhyega, nanamu kabee mpalika kuligangamalisa kwa mawasu agalaga gajabii naku mweni, ndaba mundu ana jung'aliki kinhyega ngase jukuba kabee na mahakau. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Tumbuka sajenu, nala kutama kwinu kokuhigali punndema pani kupalika kuloguswa ngati ejupala Sapanga, na nga kwa ndokule iliya yi kimundo. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Kipindi sesapeta mwabiya ni kipindi kilasu sukuhenga majambu gagahengwa na bandu banga kummanya Sapanga. Mwatama maisa gu ugoni na ndokule jiliya nu ulepi nu kulobe nu kuhenga mahengu gi iyoni na tipati ja kunywa namangani nu kulumbali isapanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Henu bandu banga kummanya Sapanga asangaa paabona ngase nzongana nabu kabee mu kuhenga majambu gilia haga ngani nu kutama lya, na henu atenda kunntondo. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Lakini biipalika kujibii lijambu le heli palongi jaka Sapanga jojubii tayali kwaatemu baabi bomi na baakuwiki! <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ndi ndaba Lijambu la Amboni lilandiwi nakwa bandu baakuwiki, ili baada jukutemuliwa mu maisa gabu ngati bangi, atama ndaba jaka Sapanga kwi indela ja Loho.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumi sapi nhupi yaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Mwisu wa hindu yoti guhegalii. Henu mpalika mulilingaliya nu kukukeluki ili nhwesa kuloba. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Kupeta haga goti mpalana kwa mwoju woti, ndaba upali guyekale mahakau gingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mmbiya nnzopana mwabeti na mwabeti bila kunyenyeteka. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kila jumu jupalika kutumii nhupi jaki jeampeki Sapanga kwa kwaajangati bangi ngati atumisi baamboni baajemale nhupi ndalindali yaka Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Jojulandi julandila malobi gaka Sapanga; jojutumaki jupalika kutumaki kwa makili gajupata kwa Sapanga, ili mu majambu goti, Sapanga julumbalika kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu jojuwe ulumbi na makili ndi gaki yaka petapeta na petapeta! Amina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kung'alika ndaba jaka Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Mwaalongu bangu, mwisangaa ndaba ji milengu mikolongu jempata ngati mpatwa na sindu sanga sa kawaida. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ila ntogulaninya ana nnzongana mu mang'aliku gaka Kilisitu ili nhwesa kuba nu kutogule ngani kipindi su ulumbii waki pagwiyekuliwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Nambanga mwanganaya ana atenda kuntondola kwa ndaba jaka Kilisitu, lijambu leheli lilangi ana Loho jaka Sapanga, yani Loho ju ulumbi, jitama nkati jino. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Jiikuba mundu jokapi kati jinu jojuwe jupalika kung'alika kwa ndaba jukukoma au wii au jojuhenga majambu gilia au kujingali majambu ga bandu bangi. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Lakini ana mundu jung'aliki ndaba jombi nkilisitu, nala jiibona iyoni, ila ansengula Sapanga, ndaba mundu hoju jukemwa kwi lihina laka Kilisitu.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Kipindi sukutemu kihikiki, nu kutemu je hoku kutumbuli na bandu baka Sapanga mweni. Ana kutemu jehoku kutumbulii kwitu twepani, nala mwisu waki wiibia boo kwa bandu banga kuhobale lijambu laamboni laka Sapanga? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ngati egapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">“Ana kunonwipi kwaka mundu jojuhenga ngati ejupala Sapanga kuokolewa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">kwiibiya boo henu, kwa bandu banga kundumbali Sapanga na bana mahakau?” <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Henu, bandu baang'alika kulengana na ejupala Sapanga, aendelea kuhenga majambu gagabii gamboni nukulibeka beni kwaka jojubombiki jojuhobaleka ngani.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulonda likundi laka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nepani nunseja kati jinu mwaaseja ajangu, nepani ndi nenagabweni mang'aliku gaka Kilisitu nukujongana mu ulumbi gola gogwiyekuliwa, nundoba ngamaa, <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />mulilima li likundi laka Sapanga lebunkabisi, mulilonda nga kukulasimika, ila sukupala mwabeti ngati ejupala Sapanga. Nhenga lihengu leheli nga kukutokule lupija, ila kwa moju winu woti. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Nkotuka kwaalongo kwa makili bandu babumpeki kwaalonda, lakini mmbia lilenganu la mboni kwa bandu be haba. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Ni kipindi Nndimi Nkolongu pajipitila, mwanganya mwiijopa liseketule lu ulumbi langa kunyala.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Kabee nanamu mwaka akombu kupalika kulibeka pai ju ulongosi wa aseja. Mwanganya mwaboti mpalika kuba ba mulihulu ili nhuwesa kujangatana, ndaba Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga: “Sapanga jaapenga baabikipuna, lakini jaapeke uamboni waka Sapanga babilihulu. <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ndienu, mulihulua pai ju kuboku kwaka Sapanga jojubi na makili, ili junkwea kwikipindi sekipalika. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Mumbekila matatisu ginu goti, ndaba jombi jutenda kundonda mwanganya.”<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />“Ntama mihu, nkelukiya! Ndaba mbaja winu, Lijobi leliyongalota ngati lihimba lelilundamii, litaputa mundu jukunkoma. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Mmbiya nganganganga mu kuhobale nu kumpenga, koni mmanyiki babunhobale Kilisitu pundema poti apata mang'aliku gagaga. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Lakini ananng'aliki kipindi kisokopi, Sapanga jojubii utumbuli wa uamboni waka Sapanga woti na jo junkema kuba pamu mu ulumbi waki wa yaka petapeta mu kujongana ni Kilisitu, jombi mweni janhenga mmbia mo ntosani nu kumpeke usakaka, makili ni misingi nganganganga. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kwaki jombi gubiya uwesu wa yaka petapeta!” Amina.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamuki gukujomule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Nunhandaki mwanganya balua jenze inyipi kukujangatiwa na silwano, nndongu wangu jojuwe numanyiki nu kunhobale. Mbala kunngangamalisa moju nu kumpwagi ganagabweni nukujoana ana lijambu heli la waamboni wasakaka waka Sapanga. Ntama nganganganga mu uamboni we hogu.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Likundi la ajitu lelihaguliwi na Sapanga pani pa Babeli atenda kundamuki. Ahelahela mwana wangu Maluko mu kujongana na Kilisitu najombi jutenda kundamuki. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Nndamukaninya ku upali wiki Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">“Numpeke lukwali mwanganya mombii bandu baka Kilisitu.”<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>